// THE OTHER MODULE, AND IT IS CORRECT ON DISK.
//
// The wrong programs in this test arrive as BUFFERS, never as files:
// `tests/run.py` compiles every module it stages, so a fault on disk
// would fail the test before it ran. An editor's unsaved buffer is the
// only place a wrong program can live, which is the overlay's whole
// reason for existing.
Point* = {
    x*: i32,
    y*: i32,
}
